+// === Plugin Prompt / Options Section ===
+// Quasar zeroes the top padding of a card section that follows another, and the
+// plugin's form section scrolls (overflow: auto). The outlined notch floats the
+// label onto the field's top border (see QField.scss), ~6px above the control,
+// so without padding the scroll box clips the label whenever it floats.
+.q-dialog-plugin .q-card__section + .q-card__section.q-dialog-plugin__form {
+  padding-top: 8px;
+}
+
